  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In the San Cha Mountain three-way clash, Tie Mu Bai’s body is covered in gold-red light from this Gu while Wu Gui stands on a dark cloud and Ku Mo flaps bone wings; the three peak stage Gu Masters face each other in the open sky. When they strike together, the exchange moves faster than ordinary eyes can track, and unceasing explosions ravage the spectators’ eardrums.",
        "chapters": [
          373
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_gu_masters"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After killing Tie Mu Bai, Fang Yuan excavates Golden Aurora Gu among the four rank four Gu on that corpse, all of them high quality metal path worms.",
        "chapters": [
          379
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fleeing at San Cha Mountain, he activates it so his body is covered in golden light and his speed rises.",
        "chapters": [
          398
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Later he counts it among movement Gu taken from slain rank five Gu Masters and activates it with others while flying against a waterfall of light.",
        "chapters": [
          404
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_movement_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "A rank five killer move greatly damages Golden Aurora Gu along with other Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          405
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Much later, among metal path Gu in a gold fragment current, Golden Aurora Gu appears beside Golden Dragon Gu and can allow a Gu Master to fly.",
        "chapters": [
          1155
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_golden_dragon_gu",
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
